script = ExtResource("3_x6hd0")
sender = "Hassan"
subject = "Meeting policy reminder"
body = "Hi team,

You guys all have been such helping hands lately. That last minute meeting really saved the project.

For those absent, remember a full day's notice is required. Time is money, and our employees should know that. I must emphasize that you must be at every mandatory meeting, at minimum, even if you have three in one day.

Hassan
[i]Communications Director[/i]
